Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.94,0:00:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Short version is, this spring, I\Nhave some plans to travel abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you now? Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.42,0:00:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, to Italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Italy? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which brings me to my request.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you please use Heaven's\NDoor to make me fluent in Italian?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.92,0:00:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need you to make a better\Ncase for why I'd ever do any such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.66,0:00:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth is, I've never left the country\Nalone, and I feel extremely nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.46,0:00:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So at the very least, I'd really like\Nto be able to speak the language.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please help me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:00:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bound for Italy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.70,0:01:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you'd like to hear a\Nstory about my own time there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we first met, I was\Nforced on a brief hiatus!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.50,0:01:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Due in no small part to a certain someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.14,0:01:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During that period of time, I\Nundertook some research for my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A journey which took me to Venice,\Nwhere I stayed for eight days.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the story I discovered\Nwas truly mind-boggling?
