Dialogue: 2,0:02:06.85,0:02:12.32,Title,,0,0,0,,{=0}{\fscy100\an2\blur0.75\fnKozuka Mincho Pro Strp B\fs95\pos(1110,620)\fscx90}“AT A CONFESSIONAL”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.74,0:02:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very own ears its genre is horror
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.70,0:02:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tell me do you know what a confessional
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.08,0:02:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is the practice is found in all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.42,0:02:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,italian churches and occurs in a set of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.14,0:02:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wooden booths the one with the curtains\Nis occupied by the parish priest
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.16,0:02:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while the other is occupied by the\Nparishioner a small window connects their
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.20,0:02:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,respective booths, allowing them\Nto hear each other's voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.56,0:02:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, at no point can they see
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:02:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.85,0:03:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A very accommodating design, it enables\Nthe parishioner to confess their sins
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.76,0:03:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without ever revealing their identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.26,0:03:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The heart isn't built to\Nstore secrets indefinitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.44,0:03:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After many years, it may break.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.60,0:03:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the graver the secret, the\Ngreater the strain it is forced
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.72,0:03:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to endure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.63,0:03:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thus, a confessional provides a\Nmeans of relief for the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.02,0:03:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such was the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.78,0:03:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wisdom of its creators.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.02,0:03:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though it was against the rules,\NI captured some photos while the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,priest wasn't around, to study the more\Nintricate details of its design later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.68,0:03:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, for the sake of the experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd partake in\Na confession of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I entered at the booth, it would\Nsurely help the authenticity of my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, I have come to confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.42,0:04:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.33,0:04:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've committed a great sin
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot bear to hold it in any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.30,0:04:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.04,0:04:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to sleep until I confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.44,0:04:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.30,0:04:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at the time I did not\Nknow the booth with the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.50,0:04:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,curtains was actually\Nmeant for the priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.28,0:04:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a result, I suddenly found\Nmyself receiving a confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.68,0:04:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It it was a great stroke of luck,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.90,0:04:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what is this great sin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.96,0:04:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't hurt to listen to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.12,0:04:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real experiences are\Nwhat yield great works,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.92,0:04:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it shouldn't matter who\Nhears the confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.80,0:04:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as this man continues\Nto believe I am the priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.72,0:04:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I imagine there shouldn't\Nbe any harm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:05:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, is there something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.64,0:05:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.18,0:05:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, my child, I how should I begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.28,0:05:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.06,0:05:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.28,0:05:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, all of this began\Nthe evening of that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.08,0:05:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was 24 years old at the time, and\Nmade a modest living at a food market,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.20,0:05:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as a manual laborer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd spend my days hauling sacks of corn\Nbetween the storehouse and the trucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.60,0:05:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.96,0:05:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The job left me no time\Nfor a personal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was always working, and I hated it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:06:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then one day, sometime after 6 o 'clock,\Nas work carried on late like it always did,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the corner of my eye, I\Nspotted a man approaching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.52,0:06:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way he staggered, the emptiness in\Nhis eyes, the stench that covered him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.58,0:06:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could tell at once, he was a vagrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.06,0:06:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg you, spare me some food, please sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.98,0:06:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sounded pitiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.72,0:06:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I caught him repeatedly stealing\Nglances at my meal on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.06,0:06:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It made me swell with anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.04,0:06:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought to myself, how dare he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.74,0:06:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been working like a dog all day while
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.82,0:06:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's been lazing around\Nin a park somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.14,0:06:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet he wants my food?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a selfish bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.14,0:06:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, whenever I get hungry, I go and\Nbuy food with my own hard-earned money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.08,0:06:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why exactly can't you\Ndo the same? Tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.70,0:06:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You put away all these sacks in\Nthe storehouse, then I'll feed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.24,0:06:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will work, sir. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.52,0:07:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, I'm begging you\Nto give me something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I haven't eaten in five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.98,0:07:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need a little something in the\Ntank, then I'll get right to it, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.34,0:07:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That isn't how things work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.32,0:07:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People only get paid after\Nthey finish their job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.42,0:07:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, are you going to\Nstart hauling or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.92,0:07:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa there, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.34,0:07:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're\Ndoing with that tiny one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.80,0:07:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your sacks are over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big boy like you can\Nfinish in an hour, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I want to go home already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.62,0:07:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too slow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.86,0:07:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pick up the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.08,0:07:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or did you decide you're\Nnot that hungry after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.66,0:07:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, you lazy shit-smelling asswipe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.78,0:08:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm doing you a favor by\Nwhipping your ass into shape!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.22,0:08:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you actually think I'm gonna\Nfall for you playing dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.10,0:08:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, who faints after\Njust ten minutes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.54,0:08:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm playing dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a closer look?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.64,0:08:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then you can tell me again if\Nyou still think I'm playing dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.40,0:08:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.53,0:08:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you couldn't bear\Nthe sight of me before,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.66,0:08:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why did you throw me even deeper\Ninto this putrid sea of despair?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.04,0:08:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, I will never\Nforget your face, ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.10,0:08:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to pay you back\Nproperly for what you've done to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.82,0:08:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for the happiest day of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.08,0:09:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will happen on the day you\Ncherish more than any other!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.66,0:09:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll come back to pay you a little\Nvisit and take what I am owed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.92,0:09:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.86,0:09:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.60,0:09:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think there's somebody\Ncrushed underneath this sack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.90,0:09:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.82,0:09:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh shit! You're right. He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.42,0:09:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone call a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.90,0:09:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.18,0:09:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The police!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.36,0:09:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think he'd.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he said he hadn't\Neaten for five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.82,0:09:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't tell if he was lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.28,0:09:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.52,0:09:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.76,0:09:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.67,0:09:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The vagrant spoke after he'd already died.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.22,0:09:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how is such a thing possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.34,0:09:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you didn't\Ndream this encounter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.18,0:09:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dream it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.09,0:09:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, how I wish it had been a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.90,0:09:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid I've yet to\Nget to the terrifying part.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.54,0:09:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.50,0:10:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Following that incident, I\Nexperienced an unnatural turn of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.98,0:10:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I received inheritance money.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.28,0:10:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, I won the lottery.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.28,0:10:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I invested my winnings in real estate\Nand quickly made an incredible profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.80,0:10:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was then that I came up with the\Nidea of producing corn-based snacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.12,0:10:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which all became instant worldwide\Nhits the second they hit the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.86,0:10:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after having spent my life\Nas a bachelor, I got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My wife was a model who had once\Ngraced the Milan Fashion Week stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My fortune was so vast I\Nhardly knew how to spend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.52,0:10:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At present, my estate is staffed\Nwith 15 servants, three chauffeurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.82,0:10:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But my extreme success came with constant\Nanxiety lurking in the back of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.02,0:10:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were thoughts of that dead
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.44,0:10:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,man and what he had said
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.32,0:10:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,still?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:10:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I eventually became a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A beautiful girl, just like her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.22,0:11:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to show I'll show\Nyou a super cool trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.32,0:11:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't blink, kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.92,0:11:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aww, I missed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.74,0:11:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey now, it's okay, you were so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.90,0:11:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You accidentally closed\Nyour eyes at the end there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.66,0:11:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.30,0:11:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I stood there, watching my\Ndaughter having fun in the piazza,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.90,0:11:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my worries faded, and I thought to\Nmyself, Oh, what a happy man I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.40,0:11:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as I promised you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.52,0:11:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as I promised you,\NI've come back for a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.10,0:11:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To give you what you deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.44,0:12:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young mistress, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.62,0:12:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.90,0:12:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your daughter will get her\Nbody back when we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.10,0:12:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're making a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.74,0:12:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never rocked you in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.78,0:12:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you really think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.56,0:12:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bold thing to say to a\Ndead man after enjoying
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.04,0:12:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a life filled with\Neverything you ever wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.68,0:12:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Riches, renown, family. Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.72,0:12:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, did you truly believe\Nyou got here all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.20,0:12:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without anyone secretly pulling\Nthe strings from beyond?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh? Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted you to be at your\Npeak before I struck you down,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if only to give you a small
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.24,0:12:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,taste of the despair you wrought on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.58,0:12:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the one hand, killing you is the\Nonly thing that will bring me peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.58,0:12:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But on the other, it'd be a shame if you\Ndied sincerely believing you were innocent,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.22,0:12:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'd hate to perpetuate\Nany more injustice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.14,0:12:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd be the worst, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.32,0:13:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tell you what we're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.22,0:13:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's about we let fate decide whether or\Nnot You deserve to die today that's right
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.52,0:13:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've still got a chance at life if the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.86,0:13:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heavens agree With you\Nthat is if destiny takes
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.74,0:13:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your side in my grudges\Nand deep baseless then
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'll spare your Miserable\Nlife and disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.24,0:13:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you'll never hear from me again nobody\Ncould ask for a more Impartial judge now
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wouldn't you agree well will you try your
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.00,0:13:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,luck or die where you\Nstand i i have No idea
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.54,0:13:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's going on about\Nyou'll understand soon
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.22,0:13:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now answer do you accept\Nthese conditions or
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not why why is this happening to me speak
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.98,0:13:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you idiot use that head\Nto think quickly or
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,else i'm Cutting it off yes i accept the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.70,0:13:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,conditions what other
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,choice do i have good catch
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.24,0:13:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destiny can manifest in\Nways we often overlook Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.56,0:14:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw a piece of popcorn\Nhigher than that street
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.16,0:14:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lamp and catch it in\Nyour mouth as it falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.68,0:14:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it three times in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.78,0:14:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you succeed, destiny is on your\Nside and I'll disappear as promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.56,0:14:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A silly game is deciding my fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.90,0:14:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll remind you that my fate\Nwill also be affected by this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.48,0:14:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better watch what\Nyou call a silly game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.70,0:14:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll throw as soon as I clap my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.20,0:14:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the popcorn doesn't fly high\Nenough or you take too long,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.26,0:14:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.44,0:14:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So get ready, because we're\Nstarting right now! No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.12,0:14:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please give me a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.68,0:14:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up it goes, and clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.86,0:14:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.78,0:14:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I being forced to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see it falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.36,0:14:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.44,0:14:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.74,0:15:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was way too close,\Nbut I actually did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.42,0:15:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I caught it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.18,0:15:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.64,0:15:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for round two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab another piece of\Npopcorn and let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.34,0:15:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, wait, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun was in my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.68,0:15:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It completely blinded me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can just continue\Nthis in the shade, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.54,0:15:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next you'll ask for a juice\Nbox and a pat on the head. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.08,0:15:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll throw the popcorn right\Nhere, and you'll throw it right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.66,0:15:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two more to go, hop to it, and\Nremember if you miss, you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.52,0:15:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you succeed, I'll disappear\Nwithout saying another word.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.90,0:15:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, your second throw, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.74,0:15:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I make all three, you swear\Nyou'll disappear for good?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.36,0:15:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's what it'll take to\Nsave my life, then so be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.40,0:15:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.84,0:15:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make your throw now or you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.94,0:16:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.10,0:16:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be way easier\Nwith the sun obscured!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see it coming straight down to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that! How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.96,0:16:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the little birdies\Nwant to join the party!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.18,0:16:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.09,0:16:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.24,0:16:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That there was the second one in the\Ncan! Boom! That's right! I'm on a roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.02,0:16:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I can't believe I thought\Nthis was gonna be difficult,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.58,0:16:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm getting the hang of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.24,0:16:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can win!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.42,0:16:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stop me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.66,0:16:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel free to celebrate\Nas much as your rotten
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.52,0:16:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little heart desires\Nafter we're actually done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.80,0:16:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for the final throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.02,0:16:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:16:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smack those hands together!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.78,0:17:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one more...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.96,0:17:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.08,0:17:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're screaming rather loud for someone\Nwho brought this down upon himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.38,0:17:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you think was going to happen when\Nyou scattered that whole bag of popcorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.28,0:17:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.78,0:17:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.66,0:17:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I throw it higher\Nthan the street lamp...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.98,0:17:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You greedy bastards! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.56,0:17:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.70,0:17:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing left!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.10,0:17:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.30,0:17:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make your last throw!\NAh! Wait! Just a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.00,0:17:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.16,0:18:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those stupid pigeons won't\Ngo anywhere near the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.44,0:18:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I oiled it up and lit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worked like a freakin' charm!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Home stretch, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pack your bags and get ready to bounce!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.23,0:18:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A flame!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.36,0:18:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did it go? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.04,0:18:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sunlight's completely engulfed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.52,0:18:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.98,0:18:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see it! No! Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destiny has spoken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you did deserve\Nto lose your head after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.10,0:19:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wondering how I'm sitting\Nhere, speaking with you right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.94,0:19:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,aren't you, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.80,0:19:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, it's the same\Nreason for my visit today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.82,0:19:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot bear it myself any longer,\Nthat despicable sin I've committed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.90,0:19:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The spirit of that vagrant,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.86,0:19:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'd made me so rich that virtually\Nnothing was outside my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.22,0:19:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took almost no effort to find a\Nservant who would do anything I commanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, come out of there, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.50,0:19:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, I've told you, no matter how many\Ntimes you confess, I will never leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.60,0:20:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You who paid me off to surgically\Ndiscard my old face and take on yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.86,0:20:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only to throw me into the maw of such a
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.30,0:20:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,terrifying nightmare without\Neven a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.46,0:20:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.64,0:20:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will bear this grudge\Ntill the end of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.72,0:20:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're able to follow\Nme even into the church?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.40,0:20:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen closely to my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.56,0:20:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day which your sweet,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.92,0:20:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dear daughter cherishes\Nmore than any other
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.44,0:20:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will be the day that I\Ncome to exact my revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't let him out of your sight till then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.62,0:20:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, he'll just cook up\Nanother one of those dirty tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.24,0:20:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wherever you may tread, we'll\Nbe one step behind you always!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.14,0:21:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.05,0:21:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's scary! Uh, Okuyasu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.44,0:21:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Yukako?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.64,0:21:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, Rohan-sensei, was that really\Na true story you just told us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.24,0:21:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, can I get a\Nthing of Baby tea over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.76,0:21:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did you show up exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.62,0:21:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and to so shamelessly accuse me of lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.94,0:21:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.20,0:21:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody said you were lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.76,0:21:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just think it's way more\Nlikely that those spooky,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.22,0:21:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,angry ghost things were stand users\Nrather than vengeful spirits or whatever,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.90,0:21:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.81,0:21:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, either way, they're\Nremarkably patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.34,0:21:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I can't imagine having ghosts\Nhaunt me for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.58,0:21:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.68,0:21:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Koichi, you'll have to tell me\Nright away if that ever happens to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.68,0:21:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll come banish the mean ghost\Nbefore it lays a finger on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.76,0:21:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.72,0:21:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's become of that man since?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.92,0:21:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, Rohan Kishibe, have yet to discover.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.48,0:22:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should give some thought\Nto paying him another visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.66,0:22:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps next year, or the year after.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.46,0:22:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He kept on walking, even with\Nthose specters trailing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.52,0:22:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alone, yet undeterred.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.76,0:22:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His may not have been a good heart,\Nbut he is undeniably resilient.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.32,0:22:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it might be that I am the only\None who thinks that about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.04,0:22:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know the truth.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.72,0:22:57.06,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I wanna know the truth of life that never ends
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.98,0:22:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of life that never melts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.72,0:22:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To chain a mystic rise.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.06,0:23:02.27,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To unchain the mystic rites I'm calling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.40,0:23:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.50,0:23:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way to find.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.44,0:23:07.74,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'm on my way to find the eternal verities
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.82,0:23:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eternal varieties.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.82,0:23:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Expanding all their tears.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.74,0:23:13.45,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Exploding all the teardrops by the sun
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.98,0:23:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.36,0:23:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel my heart beating.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.45,0:23:18.79,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I can feel my heart beating
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.12,0:23:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see my faith all spinning.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.79,0:23:29.34,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I can see my fate all spinning around beyond the time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.64,0:23:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long beyond the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.76,0:23:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rise up to the sky like a butterfly.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.34,0:23:34.64,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Rise up to the sky, like a butterfly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.18,0:23:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me what's inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.64,0:23:39.98,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Show me what's inside, don't ever let go
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.32,0:23:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know the world's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.92,0:23:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shining stars will guide me to.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:39.98,0:23:45.44,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Shining stars will guide me to somewhere high
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.58,0:23:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somewhere high.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.28,0:23:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finding the truth.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.44,0:23:51.32,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Finding the truth beyond the Heaven's Door
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.04,0:23:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beyond the heaven's door.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.34,0:24:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.14,0:24:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

